From: jetbee <7734987+jetbee@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 02:57:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] bison: add bison.real as a dependency of the arm64 wrapper

The arm64 bison is installed as bison.real and a small wrapper named bison sets
BISON_PKGDATADIR (the binary finds its data relative to linux-x86). The wrapper and the
rename are done by scripts/bison-arm64-wrapper.sh (the binary is not part of this
patch); this change lists bison.real in the module's deps.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index d3a9cc5..8a1a2a0 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -96,6 +96,7 @@ prebuilt_build_tool {
         musl_arm64: {
             src: "linux-arm64/bin/bison",
             deps: [
+                "linux-arm64/bin/bison.real",
                 "linux-arm64/lib64/libc++.so",
                 "linux-arm64/lib64/libc_musl.so",
             ],
